{
  "result": "If I could change one thing, it would be this:\n\nI\u2019d make it impossible to cause pain without feeling it yourself \u2014 exactly as the other person feels it, in your own body, in that moment.\n\nNot just knowing, abstractly, that someone is scared or hungry or humiliated. Actually *feeling* it when you do it to them.\n\nPeople could still argue. They could still disagree, be selfish, be wrong. But cruelty, indifference, war, bullying \u2014 all of that relies on distance. On not having to sit inside the other person's life for even a second.\n\nRemove that distance, and I think the world changes itself.",
